    "body": "Triage run of 2026-11-26 by the provisional triage stage (#375).\n\n- **Scope:** the 32 issues the 2026-11-24 run (#376) queued that nobody has started. Each was judged read-only against `master` at d11b795.\n- **Report:** this issue's artefact.\n- **Proposed outcome:**\n  - close #353 (superseded by #508) and #403 (duplicate of #510);\n  - keep 26 queued, 15 of them with a triage comment saying what to update;\n  - move #16, #128, #312 and #365 to blocked, adding the blocker links.\n- **Decision:** waiting for the maintainer. Reply `approve` to apply it as proposed, or name the changes.\n",
